WEBVTT

00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:05.090
<i>The ferris wheel...</i>

00:00:09.770 --> 00:00:12.280
Weren't we going to the medical office?

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:14.240
Let's look for it from up high.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:16.170
But...

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:17.120
Okay!

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:19.330
Then ride with me.

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:21.370
And we'll look for it together!

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:23.790
Huh?

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:27.750
We're getting on!

00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:08.400
<i>Wh-What do I do?</i>

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:10.230
<i>Um... Um...</i>

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:11.040
Ow!

00:02:11.040 --> 00:02:12.980
Ah! S-Sorry.

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:14.130
You okay?

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:15.980
Yes, I'm fine.

00:02:16.840 --> 00:02:18.770
Was I just holding your hand?

00:02:18.770 --> 00:02:20.320
Y-Yeah.

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:23.460
<i>I shouldn't have let go!</i>

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:25.620
Oh, right. Mari-chan.

00:02:26.050 --> 00:02:27.850
I have a lot of missed calls.

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:31.960
Hello?

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:33.310
Anna!

00:02:33.310 --> 00:02:35.960
Where are you?!

00:02:35.960 --> 00:02:38.390
On the ferris wheel with Hashiba-kun.

00:02:38.390 --> 00:02:39.750
The ferris wheel?

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:40.900
With that little monkey?!

00:02:40.900 --> 00:02:42.980
It's complicated.

00:02:42.980 --> 00:02:44.600
How are you feeling?

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:46.190
I'm fine now!

00:02:46.190 --> 00:02:47.930
Wait, I'm not fine at all!

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:49.400
Huh? Are you okay?

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:50.480
What's this?

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:54.100
Sounds like Kobayakawa-san and Natsuki
are on the ferris wheel together.

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:55.150
Wow!

00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:56.550
Get back down here quick!

00:02:56.550 --> 00:02:58.590
I'll be waiting!

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:02.570
Mari-chan says she's better now.

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:03.810
Thank goodness.

00:03:03.810 --> 00:03:05.970
I'm sorry for dragging you in here.

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:08.450
You looked troubled,
so I couldn't help myself.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:10.070
Yeah.

00:03:10.070 --> 00:03:13.050
He dragged me off,
saying we'd go get medicine.

00:03:13.050 --> 00:03:16.560
Then he suggested we ride this to look
for the medical office, for some reason.

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:18.270
I wonder what he wanted.

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:21.750
I'm pretty sure he was just
trying to pick you up.

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:22.550
Huh?

00:03:22.550 --> 00:03:24.340
Oh, I see!

00:03:24.340 --> 00:03:26.830
I don't get hit on that often.

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:29.220
But I did think he was acting a bit strange...

00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:30.850
<i>Pay attention to that!</i>

00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:33.170
Oh, look.

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:34.650
It's heart-shaped.

00:03:34.820 --> 00:03:35.730
Huh?

00:03:35.740 --> 00:03:36.980
See?

00:03:37.810 --> 00:03:38.730
You're right.

00:03:39.850 --> 00:03:41.650
<i>We got on it.</i>

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:43.990
<i>I'm so lucky!</i>

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:46.660
"This car of happiness
will guarantee requited love

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:51.960
and long-lasting relationships," it says.

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:54.690
D-Does it?

00:03:54.690 --> 00:03:55.920
That's a pity.

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:56.380
Huh?

00:03:56.810 --> 00:03:59.920
Yukirin and Naoe-kun should've
been the ones to ride this.

00:04:00.560 --> 00:04:03.320
<i>She says that like there's
no point in her riding with me...</i>

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:05.390
When I see Yukirin and Naoe-kun...

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:06.510
Huh?

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:10.040
...l can tell they're very happy.

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:13.920
It makes me want them to be together forever.

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:16.900
I kind of wish I had something like that, too.

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:20.880
It's nice, isn't it?
They're wonderful together.

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:22.550
Yeah, you're right.

00:04:22.550 --> 00:04:26.260
<i>So that's what Kobayakawa-san meant...</i>

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:30.710
<i>I've never talked about
romance with her before.</i>

00:04:30.710 --> 00:04:33.040
<i>But, I feel like I can today.</i>

00:04:33.490 --> 00:04:34.390
Um...

00:04:35.240 --> 00:04:39.030
Kobayakawa-san, have you ever
gone out with someone?

00:04:39.930 --> 00:04:40.880
I haven't, actually.

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:43.370
<i>She hasn't? Aw, yeah!</i>

00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:45.640
Th-Then, is there someone you like?

00:04:45.640 --> 00:04:48.510
What's your type?
You can use a celebrity as an example.

00:04:48.900 --> 00:04:51.170
Well, as far as celebrities go...

00:04:51.170 --> 00:04:52.700
Yo Oizumi, maybe?

00:04:52.700 --> 00:04:54.700
Oh, uh, I see.

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:57.400
I think he's very funny.

00:04:57.650 --> 00:05:00.300
<i>She likes funny people?</i>

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:02.540
<i>I'm not funny at all.</i>

00:05:02.540 --> 00:05:04.610
But I don't know, really.

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:05.930
Huh?

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:08.130
I've never had a crush on anyone.

00:05:08.130 --> 00:05:10.580
Really? Not ever?

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:11.280
No.

00:05:11.560 --> 00:05:15.750
It's like I'm not the type
to be in a relationship.

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:20.520
That's part of being an adult,
and I always felt it was too soon for me.

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:22.190
So I'd never considered it.

00:05:22.820 --> 00:05:25.670
And I didn't have many boys
in my life to begin with.

00:05:26.080 --> 00:05:31.100
But lately, I've gotten more
interested than I used to be.

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:35.170
I've started wondering,
"Will I be in a relationship someday?"

00:05:35.780 --> 00:05:37.020
That sort of thing.

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:38.920
Though wondering is all I've done.

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:41.650
I'm sorry.

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:43.900
Uh, why are you apologizing?

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:47.900
I have no experience, so I can't
talk in much detail. I'm boring you.

00:05:48.230 --> 00:05:49.860
Th-That's not true at all!

00:05:50.390 --> 00:05:52.780
Everyone finds love in their own time.

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:55.200
You're interested in it now, right?

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:58.520
I'm sure yours is still to come.

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:01.870
<i>Mine is... still to come?</i>

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:04.170
You... You think so?

00:06:04.170 --> 00:06:05.560
Hm? Huh?

00:06:05.560 --> 00:06:07.670
Kobayakawa-san, are you blushing?

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:09.630
Um, well...

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:13.790
I've never talked about
these things with a boy before.

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:16.520
I might be a little embarrassed.

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:17.430
Ah!

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:19.720
Sorry I'm not used to it.

00:06:19.720 --> 00:06:21.770
No, I should be the one apologizing.

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:25.460
I imagine it's easier for you to talk
about these things with other girls.

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:27.780
Well...

00:06:28.590 --> 00:06:29.670
What about you, Hashiba-kun?

00:06:29.670 --> 00:06:30.890
Huh?

00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:32.720
Uh, sorry.

00:06:32.720 --> 00:06:34.650
I was just curious.

00:06:34.650 --> 00:06:36.200
What type do you like?

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:38.360
My type is...

00:06:38.360 --> 00:06:40.120
...cute girls, maybe?

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:42.090
Cute girls?

00:06:42.090 --> 00:06:43.260
There are a lot of them.

00:06:43.260 --> 00:06:45.180
That's true, but...

00:06:45.180 --> 00:06:47.050
Not that, I mean...

00:06:47.370 --> 00:06:49.570
<i>That's not it.</i>

00:06:49.570 --> 00:06:50.740
Um...

00:06:51.820 --> 00:06:55.220
<i>I want to say "Kobayakawa-san." but...</i>

00:06:55.220 --> 00:06:57.390
F-For example,

00:06:57.740 --> 00:07:00.580
if they blush when talking about love,

00:07:00.580 --> 00:07:02.560
I think that's very cute.

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:14.260
Um, Kobayakawa-san, you're blushing again.

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:19.000
Well. you're blushing even more than me.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:21.250
I get like this all the time!

00:07:21.520 --> 00:07:22.580
Oh, you do?

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:23.330
Yeah.

00:07:25.360 --> 00:07:27.340
Wh-What is it!?

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:28.840
I'm sorry.

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:30.440
I couldn't help myself.

00:07:30.440 --> 00:07:31.490
Um...

00:07:32.060 --> 00:07:33.840
It was just so funny.

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:37.290
Both of us are blushing.

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:39.180
It seemed so weird,
I couldn't help laughing.

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:42.300
Y-Yeah. It is weird.

00:07:42.300 --> 00:07:42.980
Weird!

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:44.850
It is pretty weird.

00:07:47.740 --> 00:07:49.280
Thank you for your patronage!

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:51.960
Please watch your step!

00:07:51.960 --> 00:07:53.950
<i>We're back already.</i>

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:01.340
<i>It really was heart-shaped.</i>

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:04.160
I need to get back to Mari-chan.

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:05.850
Oh, uh... Yeah!

00:08:08.530 --> 00:08:09.670
That was fun, huh?

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:13.010
<i>Yeah!</i>

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:16.680
Anna!

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:19.070
Nice one! How'd it go?

00:08:19.070 --> 00:08:21.700
Smooth move, getting the heart-shaped one.

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:22.910
Yeah.

00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:23.350
Huh?

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:25.770
What a goofy look.

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:27.550
Something good must've happened!

00:08:27.550 --> 00:08:28.310
Anna!

00:08:28.660 --> 00:08:31.100
He didn't do anything weird to you, did he?!

00:08:31.100 --> 00:08:32.530
No, we just rode together.

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:35.020
But, it was my first time talking about love.

00:08:35.020 --> 00:08:35.740
Huh?!

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:40.540
It was a bit embarrassing,
but I really enjoyed it!

00:08:42.940 --> 00:08:45.330
Boys, you're in Room 2015.

00:08:45.730 --> 00:08:47.250
Okay.

00:08:47.520 --> 00:08:49.280
When are we having dinner?

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:50.840
Around 7:30?

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:52.020
Roger that!

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:54.680
See you later!

00:08:56.420 --> 00:08:57.340
A while back.

00:08:57.720 --> 00:09:00.010
I went to Shiretoko with Tsuyoponnu.

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:02.820
The open-air baths there were amazing, too!

00:09:02.820 --> 00:09:04.020
The scenery was breathtaking!

00:09:04.360 --> 00:09:06.110
That sounds fun.

00:09:06.110 --> 00:09:08.410
Do you go on a lot of vacations?

00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:09.500
Once in a while.

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:12.040
We went to Tokyo during summer break!

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:14.440
What? That guy's your boyfriend?

00:09:14.440 --> 00:09:15.260
Yep!

00:09:15.260 --> 00:09:17.700
Mari-chan only just realized.

00:09:18.530 --> 00:09:19.900
It must be nice...

00:09:19.900 --> 00:09:24.360
I hope I can go on a vacation
with Keiichi-san someday.

00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:26.000
Why with Katakura-kun!?

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:27.900
"Why"?

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:30.170
Because I love Keiichi-san, of course!

00:09:31.390 --> 00:09:33.570
You're head over heels!

00:09:33.570 --> 00:09:35.050
Seriously?

00:09:36.310 --> 00:09:40.760
89... 90... 91...

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:42.680
A minute and a half.

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:43.970
Kai-chan, that was amazing!

00:09:43.970 --> 00:09:46.370
Not amazing, scorching!

00:09:46.370 --> 00:09:48.400
Speaking of scorching things up.

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:50.590
Weren't you with Nozomi all day?

00:09:50.590 --> 00:09:51.820
Oh, was I?

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:53.060
Yes!

00:09:53.060 --> 00:09:55.690
Like, where were you while
I was helping Spitting Woman?

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:57.740
Huh? I was watching you.

00:09:57.740 --> 00:09:59.360
Oh?

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:00.750
And for how long?

00:10:00.750 --> 00:10:02.330
Like I said, the whole time.

00:10:02.770 --> 00:10:04.910
After you saved Tsutsui-san, you—

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:06.750
That was a total accident!

00:10:07.170 --> 00:10:08.570
An accident?

00:10:08.570 --> 00:10:09.810
What happened?

00:10:09.810 --> 00:10:12.420
Mattsun turned into an alien
from Planet Boobies.

00:10:12.730 --> 00:10:14.730
You're the one from Planet Boobies here!

00:10:14.730 --> 00:10:15.710
Well, yeah.

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:17.530
I'm an ass man!

00:10:17.530 --> 00:10:19.740
Um, what are we talking about?

00:10:19.740 --> 00:10:21.820
I prefer the upper arms.

00:10:21.820 --> 00:10:23.100
Not you too, Tsuyopon?!

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:24.360
How about you, Na-chan?

00:10:24.360 --> 00:10:25.730
Uh, me?

00:10:25.730 --> 00:10:28.770
You like any part, as long as
it's on Kobayakawa-san, right?

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:29.810
Enough already!

00:10:30.210 --> 00:10:32.610
The heart's blessing helped, didn't it?

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:37.030
Yeah, I think it did.

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:38.310
What happened?

00:10:38.310 --> 00:10:40.950
Come on, tell us!

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:45.410
Mari-chan, would you
like help drying your hair?

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:45.870
Sure!

00:10:50.900 --> 00:10:52.280
Say, Anna...

00:10:52.280 --> 00:10:54.520
What came up in your conversation about love?

00:10:54.520 --> 00:10:55.170
Huh?

00:10:55.710 --> 00:10:59.670
Hm, I think we talked about
what types of people we like.

00:10:59.670 --> 00:11:01.590
I don't really know.

00:11:01.600 --> 00:11:02.980
Yeah, that's right!

00:11:02.980 --> 00:11:04.720
You don't know about that stuff!

00:11:04.720 --> 00:11:06.430
You said that before, right? Right?

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:08.100
Yeah.

00:11:08.420 --> 00:11:10.550
I still don't know about it,

00:11:10.550 --> 00:11:12.770
but I'd like to find out.

00:11:13.760 --> 00:11:15.480
How about... me?

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:16.530
Huh?

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:18.400
Sorry, I couldn't hear you.

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:18.940
What?

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:22.610
It's nothing!

00:11:22.610 --> 00:11:24.660
Forget it. I'm so hungry!

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:26.000
Let's eat our fill!

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:27.010
Yeah!
